---
description: GitHub Actions CI must run the same lint and test commands
globs: .github/workflows/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# CI

- Lint workflow: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`
- Test workflow: `.github/workflows/test.yml`
- Frontend test: Vitest (`pnpm test:run`)
- Backend test: pytest
- Do not mix lint commands into `test.yml`.
- Do not add secrets or env files.
- Do not add deploy jobs in this phase.
